INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (6548,1,'2025-10-01 08:18:44','2025-10-01 08:18:44','<h2>Overview</h2><p>National Bank of Canada is a large, integrated financial group and one of\nCanada\'s six systemically important banks, founded in 1859. It operates through four\nbusiness segments—Personal and Commercial Banking, Wealth\nManagement, Financial Markets, and U.S. Specialty Finance and International—to offer\na comprehensive range of services, including retail banking, investments, insurance,\ncredit, savings, and specialized corporate and institutional services in Canada and\nabroad.</p>\n<h3>Why we recommend</h3><p>National Bank of Canada is one of the country’s leading financial institutions, known for its stability, wide range of services, and commitment to supporting newcomers. They provide trusted banking solutions tailored to help you get settled quickly and securely.</p>\n<h3>How it helps</h3><p>From opening your first Canadian bank account to setting up credit, savings, and everyday transactions, National Bank makes managing your finances simple. Their newcomer programs are designed to give you the tools and support you need to build a strong financial foundation in Canada.</p>','National Bank of Canada','','publish','open','closed','','national-bank-of-canada','','','2025-10-18 06:44:19','2025-10-18 06:44:19','',0,'https://wp-smooth-demo.local/service/national-bank-of-canada/',0,'service','',0);
