INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (6559,1,'2025-10-01 08:18:49','2025-10-01 08:18:49','<h2>Overview</h2><p>Remitly is a digital remittance service that enables users to send money internationally\nquickly, affordably, and securely, primarily, to family and friends. To use it, you create an\naccount on the Remitly website or mobile app, enter the recipient\'s details and desired\namount, select a delivery option like bank deposit, cash pickup, or mobile money, and\npay for the transfer. Remitly guarantees on-time delivery or refunds your fees and uses\nmultiple security layers to protect transfers.</p>\n<h3>Why we recommend</h3><p>We recommend Remitly for its fast transfers, multiple payout options, and reliable customer support. With Remitly, you can choose how your money is delivered—whether it’s direct to a bank account, as a cash pickup, or even delivered to a mobile wallet. Their secure platform ensures peace of mind, while competitive rates and speed make sending money abroad both affordable and convenient. For newcomers supporting family overseas, Remitly offers a trusted and flexible way to stay connected financially.</p>\n<h3>How it helps</h3><p>Remitly helps newcomers easily send money to family or manage finances across borders, reducing stress during relocation. Their platform offers multiple delivery options, including bank deposits, cash pickups, and mobile wallets, providing flexibility to suit different needs. Transfers are fast, secure, and reliable, giving you peace of mind that your money will reach its destination safely. By simplifying international payments, Remitly allows you to focus on settling into your new country while staying connected financially with loved ones.</p>','Remitly','','publish','open','closed','','remitly','','','2025-10-01 08:18:58','2025-10-01 08:18:58','',0,'https://wp-smooth-demo.local/service/remitly/',0,'service','',0);
