INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (6566,1,'2025-10-01 08:18:51','2025-10-01 08:18:51','<h2>Overview</h2><p>Wise is a financial technology company that\nprovides online money transfer services and a multi-currency account for\nindividuals and businesses to send, spend, and receive money\ninternationally at low fees and the mid-market exchange rate. Key features\ninclude high-speed, low-fee international transfers, a debit card for\nspending in different currencies, and the ability to hold balances in over 40\ncurrencies.</p>\n<h3>Why we recommend</h3><p>We recommend Wise for its transparency, speed, and cost-effectiveness compared to traditional banks. With clear, upfront fees and real exchange rates, Wise ensures you always know exactly what you’re paying for, without hidden charges. Their platform is designed for fast and secure international transfers, making it easier to move money across borders. Whether you’re sending funds to family, paying for services, or managing finances in multiple countries, Wise offers a simple and affordable solution you can trust.</p>\n<h3>How it helps</h3><p>Wise helps newcomers move money internationally with ease, making it simpler to manage expenses and support family abroad during relocation. Their platform offers fast and secure transfers at low, transparent fees, ensuring you get the best value for your money. With real exchange rates and no hidden charges, Wise removes the uncertainty often associated with international banking. This makes managing finances across countries straightforward, allowing you to focus on settling into your new home with confidence.</p>','Wise','','publish','open','closed','','wise','','','2025-10-01 08:18:58','2025-10-01 08:18:58','',0,'https://wp-smooth-demo.local/service/wise/',0,'service','',0);
