INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (6584,1,'2025-10-01 08:18:53','2025-10-01 08:18:53','<h2>Overview</h2><p>Covermore is a global travel insurance provider that offers protection\nfor travelers from unforeseen costs like medical emergencies, lost luggage, and trip\ncancellations. It functions by offering various insurance plans that cover a range of\ntravel-related incidents, providing a financial safety net and access to 24/7 emergency\ntravel assistance services. The process involves purchasing a plan, and if a covered\nevent occurs, contacting the assistance center for help and then submitting a claim for\nreimbursement or payment of expenses.</p>\n<h3>Why we recommend</h3><p>Covermore is a trusted travel insurance provider with a strong reputation for reliability and comprehensive coverage. They have years of experience supporting travelers around the world, making them a dependable choice for peace of mind on any journey. Their wide range of policies is designed to protect against unexpected costs like medical emergencies, trip cancellations, or lost baggage. With Covermore, you can travel with confidence knowing you’re backed by a company that puts your safety and security first.</p>\n<h3>How it helps</h3><p>Covermore helps newcomers and travelers protect themselves against unexpected costs, giving peace of mind during relocation or travel. Their comprehensive insurance plans cover everything from medical emergencies and trip cancellations to lost or delayed belongings. With flexible policies tailored to different needs, you can choose the coverage that fits your situation and budget. By providing reliable protection, Covermore allows you to focus on settling into your new home or enjoying your journey without unnecessary worry.</p>','Covermore','','publish','open','closed','','covermore','','','2025-10-01 08:18:58','2025-10-01 08:18:58','',0,'https://wp-smooth-demo.local/service/covermore/',0,'service','',0);
